103	  // exist iff PERFORMANCE_MONITOR_INT==1 & SSCOFPMF_SUPPORT==0 (+ privilege
104	  // terms) -- the standard Sscofpmf scheme REPLACES them. This is what the
105	  // SPA's `mmsc_cfg.PMNDS` condition compiles down to. ax46mpv_advanced
